 pouch, brown trousers, fingerless gloves and tall brown boots. Her hammer has a broad double-ended geometric head, dark inset panels, steel plates, bronze faceted fittings and narrow orange-red luminous seams. Render confident painted shapes, fine modeled-volume shading, convincing cloth/leather/metal separation, clear anatomy and expressive facial drawing. Use restrained base colors and concentrated metal highlights, without coarse pixel blocks or plastic-looking skin. Follow the user's requested pose, expression, framing and setting. Use a plain gray background only if no setting is requested. No text or watermark.\n\nUSER REQUEST:\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"The reference supplies Laema's identity, costume and hammer construction. Laema is the same young adult woman with a curious alert expression, platinum-white high ponytail, fitted blue sleeveless waistcoat, cream rolled-sleeve shirt, red waist sash, brown leather cross-body strap and pouch, brown trousers, fingerless gloves and tall brown boots. Her hammer has a broad double-ended geometric head, dark inset panels, steel plates, bronze faceted fittings and narrow orange-red luminous seams. Render confident painted shapes, fine modeled-volume shading, convincing cloth/leather/metal separation, clear anatomy and expressive facial drawing. Use restrained base colors and concentrated metal highlights, without coarse pixel blocks or plastic-looking skin. Follow the user's requested pose, expression, framing and setting. Use a plain gray background only if no setting is requested. No text or watermark.\n\nUSER REQUEST:\n"}},{"id":22,"type":"StringConcatenate","pos":[-418.33333333333337,1148.3333333333335],"size":[283.33333333333337,150],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"string_a","name":"string_a","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"string_a"},"link":26},{"localized_name":"string_b","name":"string_b","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"string_b"},"link":27},{"localize